WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: uz

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Leykoformulani hali ham qog‘ozda sanayapsizmi?

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.800
Ilovada qanday ko‘rinadi:

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.200
Leykoformula bo‘limi

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.200
