00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.800
Natija: soni va foiz jadvali

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.200
Apparat, analit, reagent

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.800
Lot va kalibrator darajalari

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.400
Yozuv jurnalga saqlanadi

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.800
Sitologiya bo‘limi

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.200
Hujayralar ro‘yxati

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.600
Raqamli belgilar bilan sxema

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.200
Bilim va malakani baholash

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.600
Imtihon: savollar va vaqt

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.800
Javob bering — natijani ko‘ring

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:39.200
Tez kunda
